:1},{\"id\":246548,\"title\":\"Roses & Guns\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3vFrz79DzSBWKBkt2t7lfP68yJe.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4090909090909091,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":31923,\"title\":\"The Legend of the Condor Heroes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jH4UglJjh9pl9qNevoqofEHDGOs.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4090909090909091,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":214130,\"title\":\"Sao Noi Roi Mic\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6s7oSKAAq83hsA93ZojGrzCtyf0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4078947368421053,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":1,\"seasonName\":\"Season 1\",\"seasonOverview\":\"Bound by a debt, an illegitimate son moves in with his aloof cousin, unaware that their uneasy deal will spiral into a deep and dangerous obsession.\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fskuKS2wG3IlynvxPHTudpgcUam.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2025-11-28\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Episode 1\",\"overview\":\"Il-jo and Jung-han’s lives spiral out of control after a hospital bill and an impulsive kiss bind them together. Debt, dependence, and blurred boundaries pull them into a dangerous closeness neither is ready to face.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c2DVvNp3i6oKU95om23kpVkJmAm.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-11-28\",\"runtime\":29},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"Jung-han coldly reminds Il-jo that until the surgery debt is paid, everything about him belongs to him, forcing him to pay him back through housework. Yet beneath this control, their bond twists into a dangerous and forbidden intimacy.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xDdwABHYeqvh83UgFDsUBDNU0NY.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-11-28\",\"runtime\":31},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"Jung-han can’t understand why his desire for Il-jo runs so deep—but when Il-jo finally gathers the courage to confess, Jung-han shuts him down.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/emooSrRakFvtPPTzVA8BlYBCDwN.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-12-05\",\"runtime\":32},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"Jung-han visits Il-jo’s old home, and the two quietly revisit the warmth of their shared past, promising to meet again in Seoul. But when the day comes, Il-jo vanishes without a word—until night falls, and Jung-han finds him injured, waiting in the dark.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dlNwymlGmyQDj26QmSp7I3Qvgun.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-12-05\",\"runtime\":30},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"Jung-han and Il-jo finally define their relationship and begin their first real dates, but Il-jo’s insistence on keeping their love hidden fuels Jung-han’s growing insecurity and jealousy.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bKqJmgsE1047pkwNEhKfUv0JLEr.jpg\",\"rating\":9,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-12-12\",\"runtime\":33},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"When Il-jo suddenly goes missing, Jung-han finds him at the hospital covered in bruises, realizing he’s been threatened. A fierce argument erupts between them, pushing their relationship to the brink.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l2sHM9KT90QsEVZaucjrUlrbvFf.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-12-12\",\"runtime\":31},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"On his uncle’s memorial day, Jung-han briefly reunites with Il-jo. Their parting pushes him to uncover the truth behind the threats — a trail that leads toward something far darker.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5Xk4QaXx0mHFGBaifPV0AI6OQbN.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-12-19\",\"runtime\":28},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"Il-jo’s past finally comes to light. When Jung-han falls ill with a high fever, Il-jo returns to care for him, and the two reaffirm their feelings — quietly making promises for the future they hope to build together.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A3JWhs6gPR0eEUaEuGMvz8uttxW.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2025-12-19\",\"runtime\":30}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2025-11-28\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}